// Roller-300 design_v0_1_input_carriage — modular Design Ops chapter (VERSION 0.1)
// Role: S02 — Removable input carriage — rail/slot coupon + one_drive printable service set
// SoT: this .nbcad.jsonc. Replay: blank document only.
// Coupon: slot travel ±1.5 and size [7.4,4.4] from parameters.transmission. Slot cut length 10.4 = 7.4+3.0.
// one_drive: left_input_carriage + input caps (M3 CB D6) + wheel caps (M4 D4.4) — NOT full barrel shell.
// Nominals ONLY from PLAN.md / parameters.json. Ears/horn/clutch/strap dims / unverified clearances = VERIFY/HOLD.
// Full OD160×L210 shell remains HOLD — do not claim print release of main-shell.
